@startuml
title Varan MIS - Main Sequences

actor Registrar
participant Browser
participant "views.py" as Views
participant "ProductionReportForm" as Form
participant "Inline FormSets" as Formsets
participant "models.py" as Models
database SQLite

Registrar -> Browser : submit daily report
Browser -> Views : POST /reports/new/
Views -> Form : validate header
Views -> Formsets : validate materials/wastes
Form -> Models : clean group/date/business rules
Formsets -> Models : clean positive quantities/group match
Models -> SQLite : save report and rows
Views -> Browser : redirect to detail

== Export ==
actor Viewer
participant "analytics.py" as Analytics
participant "pdf_reports.py / excel_reports.py" as Exporter

Viewer -> Browser : click PDF or Excel
Browser -> Views : GET export URL
Views -> Analytics : aggregate filtered reports
Views -> Exporter : build management output
Exporter -> Browser : file response

@enduml
